cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this frozen pre-disclosure repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Aperture × PsiGuard — Waypoint T1–T275 Blind Comparative Study: Pre-Disclosure Snapshot"
version: "pre-disclosure-v0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
authors:
  - family-names: "Asadi"
    given-names: "Arjay"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Substratex/aperture-psiguard-waypoint-blind-study"
url: "https://github.com/Substratex/aperture-psiguard-waypoint-blind-study"
abstract: >-
  Frozen pre-disclosure research repository for the blind comparative study of
  SubstrateX Aperture™ and PsiGuard on the Waypoint T1–T275 long-horizon
  trajectory. The repository preserves the blind source, certified Aperture
  Runtime Evidence record, 275-prefix prospective replay, result lock, identity
  reconciliation, preservation artifacts, selected visual evidence surfaces,
  Paper VIII pre-unblinding manuscript, and the Evidence-Horizon Sensitivity
  discovery record. PsiGuard intervention and wandering coordinates had not
  been disclosed to Aperture at the time of this snapshot.
keywords:
  - "SubstrateX Aperture"
  - "PsiGuard"
  - "Waypoint"
  - "Longitudinal Computational Dynamics"
  - "Runtime Evidence"
  - "Evidence-Governed Computation"
  - "Chronodynamics"
  - "Evidence-Horizon Sensitivity"
  - "prospective replay"
  - "blind comparative validation"
